  "label": "Gender binary",
  "description": "The meme implicitly reinforces a gender binary by contrasting 'me' (implied non-cisgender) with 'cis girls', suggesting a binary opposition between cisgender and non-cisgender identities. This requires understanding of the gender binary concept — the traditional view that there are only two genders — and its critique in contemporary gender theory.",
